# Vending Machine using Verilog

## Description

This project implements a simple vending machine using Verilog HDL.

Product price:

    ₹10

Accepted coins:

    ₹5
    ₹10

The machine keeps track of the amount inserted.

## Inputs

    clk       : Clock signal
    reset     : Active-high reset
    coin_5    : Insert ₹5 coin
    coin_10   : Insert ₹10 coin

## Outputs

    product   : HIGH for one clock cycle when product is dispensed
    change_5  : HIGH when ₹5 change is returned

## States

    S0  : ₹0 inserted
    S5  : ₹5 inserted
    S10 : Product ready / ₹10 inserted

## Operation

### Case 1: Insert ₹10

    ₹10 inserted
         |
         v
    Product dispensed

### Case 2: Insert ₹5 + ₹5

    ₹5 + ₹5 = ₹10
         |
         v
    Product dispensed

### Case 3: Insert ₹10 + ₹5

    ₹10 + ₹5 = ₹15
         |
         v
    Product dispensed
    ₹5 change returned

## Files

    vending_machine.v
        Main vending machine RTL.

    tb_vending_machine.v
        Testbench.

    README.md
        Project documentation.

## Simulation

Compile:

    iverilog -o vending_tb vending_machine.v tb_vending_machine.v

Run:

    vvp vending_tb
